{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24569","headline":"开成二年夏闻新蝉赠梦得 · 白居易","name":"开成二年夏闻新蝉赠梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载与君别，常感新蝉鸣。\n今年共君听，同在洛阳城。\n噪处知林静，闻时觉景清。\n凉风忽嫋嫋，秋思先秋生。\n残槿花边立，老槐阴下行。\n虽无索居恨，还动长年情。\n且喜未聋耳，年年闻此声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}